<title>UK: Brent cargoes trade stronger at Aug +10 cts-trade.</title>
<headline>Brent cargoes trade stronger at Aug +10 cts-trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two early August loading Brent cargoes traded on Tuesday five cents above Monday's level, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargoes, loading August 3-5 and August 5-7 were both bought by the same refiner at August Brent +10 cents, they said.</p>
<p>On Monday an August 4-6 cargo traded at August Brent +5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Siobhan Hayden London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
</text>
